          <li>Passthrough features such as GPUs</li>
          </ul>
          <p>Set the <code>evictionStrategy</code> field to <code>None</code> for these virtual machines. The <code>None</code> strategy powers down VMs during node reboots.</p>
        </AlertDescription>
      </Alert>
      </li>
      </ul>
